# ☕ Maple & Bean Coffee Co. - Web Documentation

> A modern, responsive, and feature-rich single-page web application for **Maple & Bean Coffee Co.** Built with pure **HTML5**, **Vanilla CSS3**, and **ES6 JavaScript Modules**, featuring a vintage aesthetic, interactive ordering system, video background hero, inspectable photo carousel, lightbox gallery, and robust client-side interactivity.

🌐 **Live Demo:** [https://maple-virid.vercel.app/](https://maple-virid.vercel.app/)

