## ☕ Overview

**Maple & Bean Coffee Co.** is a handcrafted web experience designed to showcase an artisanal cafe and roastery. The application blends modern web standards with classic cafe aesthetics—featuring receipt-styled menu items ("Guest Checks"), smooth Lottie animations, full-bleed video backgrounds, custom photo lightboxes, and a live client-side cart checkout drawer.

---

## ✨ Key Features

- 🎬 **Full-Bleed Video Background**: Embedded ambient video hero section with smooth scroll prompts.
- 📜 **Guest Check Menu Design**: Unique receipt-style interactive item cards with category tab filtering (Coffee, Pastries, Extras).
- 🛒 **Interactive Order System**: Real-time quantity selectors, item selection, floating bottom total bar, and modal order breakdown with toast notification alerts.
- 🖼️ **Multi-Item Photo Carousel**: Touch-enabled carousel supporting customizable items-per-slide, auto-play rotation, and dynamic responsive updates.
- 🔍 **Fullscreen Lightbox**: Keyboard-navigable and touch-swipe enabled image inspector for photo gallery and carousel images.
- 💬 **Interactive Testimonials**: Custom paper-clip coffee cup review cards anchored across an organic wave thread graphic.
- ❓ **Accessible FAQ Accordion**: Expandable FAQ module built with full ARIA state tracking and dynamic height calculations.
- 🛡️ **Contact Form with Honeypot Security**: Form validation for name, email, and message, reinforced with a hidden honeypot field to block automated spam bots.
- ⚡ **Zero-Dependency Core**: Lightweight architecture using standard ES modules and CSS imports—no heavy frameworks required.

---

