## 🛠️ Detailed Component & Module Breakdown

### 1. Preloader (`preloader.js` & `preloader.css`)
- **Purpose**: Displays a welcoming screen while assets and fonts load.
- **Implementation**:
  - Uses `@dotlottie/player-component` to render `assets/CoffeeTea.lottie`.
  - Automatically fades out when `document.readyState === 'complete'` or after a maximum 2.5s safety timeout.
  - Removes the DOM overlay smoothly via CSS opacity transition.

### 2. Navigation & Scroll Spy (`navigation.js` & `header.css`)
- **Purpose**: Provides fixed navigation, mobile hamburger drawer, and current section highlighting.
- **Key Functions**:
  - **Sticky Header**: Toggles `.scrolled` class on standard window scroll (> 40px).
  - **Mobile Menu**: Handles mobile breakpoint nav toggle (`#menuToggle`) with click-outside auto-close.
  - **Scroll Spy**: Utilizes an `IntersectionObserver` configured with root margin `-20% 0px -50% 0px` to automatically apply `.active` class to the current navigation link.

### 3. Hero Section & Video Background (`hero.js` & `hero.css`)
- **Purpose**: Engages visitors with high-impact video branding.
- **Key Features**:
  - Full-screen container with CSS `object-fit: cover` video background (`bg.mp4`).
  - Muted autoplay fallback handler in `hero.js` to ensure reliable autoplay across mobile browser power-saving restrictions.

### 4. Guest Check Menu & Cart/Order System (`menu.js`, `menu.css`, `order-bar.css`, `modal.css`)
- **Purpose**: Interactive menu styled like vintage dining guest checks.
- **Key Functionality**:
  - **Category Tabs**: Filters items (`data-cat="coffee"`, `data-cat="pastries"`, `data-cat="extras"`) dynamically.
  - **Item Selection**: Clicking an item toggles its `.selected` state and displays custom quantity controls (`+` / `-`).
  - **Floating Order Bar**: Shows real-time count of selected items and calculated total sum. Automatically animates into view when items > 0.
  - **Checkout Modal**: Opening the order summary renders an itemized list with individual subtotals. Placed orders trigger a feedback Toast Notification (`#toastNotification`).

### 5. Inspectable Photo Carousel (`carousel.js` & `carousel.css`)
- **Purpose**: Showcases high-quality images of cafe life and beverages.
- **Key Technical Details**:
  - Responsive items per slide driven by CSS variables (`--items-per-slide`) or HTML data attributes (`data-items-per-slide`).
  - Touch swipe support (`touchstart` / `touchend` with threshold calculation).
  - Autoplay timer (5000ms) with automatic pause on mouse hover (`mouseenter` / `mouseleave`).
  - Uses `MutationObserver` to re-calculate slide widths and dot pagination if layout configuration changes.

### 6. Photo Gallery & Lightbox Viewer (`lightbox.js`, `gallery.css`, `lightbox.css`)
- **Purpose**: Displays polaroid-style photos with an interactive modal light box.
- **Key Features**:
  - Targets images in `#galleryGrid` and `#carouselTrack`.
  - Full keyboard accessibility: **Escape** key closes modal, **Left Arrow** and **Right Arrow** keys navigate photos.
  - Touch-swipe gesture controls on mobile devices.
  - Traps background document scroll (`overflow: hidden`) when modal is active.

### 7. Customer Testimonials (`testimonials.css`)
- **Purpose**: Presents customer reviews in a unique visual format.
- **Design Structure**:
  - Styled as coffee cups with lids, body contours, avatars, customer names, and rotated clip pins (`.tilt-1` through `.tilt-4`).
  - Rendered over a custom SVG wave thread graphic (`.thread-line`).

### 8. FAQ Accordion (`accordion.js` & `faq.css`)
- **Purpose**: Answers common customer questions regarding parking, reservations, and dietary options.
- **Behavior**:
  - Single-expand accordion behavior (opening one item closes previously opened items).
  - Uses `aria-expanded` attributes for accessibility.
  - Dynamically calculates `scrollHeight` for CSS smooth height transition.

### 9. Contact Form & Anti-Spam Honeypot (`contact.js` & `contact.css`)
- **Purpose**: Enables visitors to reach out or book group reservations.
- **Validation & Security**:
  - Real-time client-side validation for Name, Email (Regex: `/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/`), and Message.
  - **Honeypot Anti-Spam Trap**: Hidden field `#website` (`tabindex="-1"`, `aria-hidden="true"`). If filled out by automated web crawlers/bots, the form simulates fake success without processing spam.
  - Includes an embedded responsive Google Maps iframe pointing to EnactOn Technologies, Surat.

### 10. Back to Top Button (`back-to-top.js` & `back-to-top.css`)
- **Purpose**: Provides quick navigation back to the top of the page.
- **Mechanism**:
  - Appends floating `#backToTopBtn` to the body automatically.
  - Monitors window scroll position (> 400px) to toggle `.show` class.
  - Executes `window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' })`.

