## 🎨 Design System & Styling Guide

The styling is built entirely on custom CSS Custom Properties (Variables) defined in `css/base.css`:

| Token Name | Value | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `--bg-main` | `#FFF9F4` | Soft warm cream background |
| `--bg-card` | `#FDFBF7` | Guest check paper card background |
| `--primary-brown` | `#7F5539` | Core brand coffee brown |
| `--dark-brown` | `#3C2A21` | High-contrast text & headings |
| `--accent-maple` | `#B08968` | Subtle warm brown accent |
| `--cream-light` | `#EDE0D4` | Soft border & divider color |
| `--gold-accent` | `#D4A373` | Highlight and hover state gold |
| `--font-heading` | `'Instrument Serif', serif` | Elegant vintage display headings |
| `--font-body` | `'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif` | Clean modern UI body text |
| `--font-handwritten` | `'Kalam', cursive` | Guest check handwritten note accent |

---

## ⚡ Technologies & Libraries Used

- **HTML5**: Semantic tags (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<section>`, `<article>`, `<footer>`).
- **CSS3**: Flexbox, CSS Grid, Custom Properties, `@import` modularization, Keyframe Animations.
- **JavaScript (ES6+)**: ES Modules (`import`/`export`), DOM API, `IntersectionObserver`, `MutationObserver`, Event Listeners.
- **DotLottie Player**: `@dotlottie/player-component@2.7.12` for lightweight vector animations.
- **Google Fonts**: *Instrument Serif*, *Plus Jakarta Sans*, *Permanent Marker*, *Kalam*, *Marck Script*.
- **Google Maps Embed API**: Interactive location map integration.

